1:00:00-0400</a></p><p><b>onset</b>: 2015-10-31</p><p><b>abatement</b>: 2015-12-01</p><p><b>recordedDate</b>: 2015-11-01</p><h3>Stages</h3><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td style=\"display: none\">-</td><td><b>Summary</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"display: none\">*</td><td><span title=\"Codes:{http://snomed.info/sct 258219007}\">stage II</span></td></tr></table></div>"^^rdf:XMLLiteral ]
